All green. Here's a summary of every change made:

**Bug fix (`src/ui/drill.ts`):**
- `renderCard` now calls `document.querySelectorAll(".drill-next").forEach(btn => btn.remove())` before rebuilding the card, so any leftover Next/Finish button from the previous card is gone before the new one can be added.
- `showCard` resets an `answered` flag to `false` before each card. `handleAnswer` checks that flag and returns immediately on a second call, so a stale button or double-click can never score or advance a card twice.

**Regression test (`src/ui/drill.test.ts`):**
- `// @vitest-environment happy-dom` at the top; 8 assertions covering the exact repro path: button count after each answer, progress label sequence (1/3, 2/3, 3/3), Finish label on the last card, final summary text ("2 correct, 1 missed"), and double-submit guard.

**Config (`vitest.config.ts`):** `include` widened to also pick up `src/ui/**/*.test.ts`; lib coverage settings unchanged.

**Specs:** AC 21 added to R5 in `requirements.md`; regression test bullet added and refs updated in T9 of `tasks.md`.
